      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Turns a topic plus tonality, audience, length and\nlocale into a structured story: light side, dark side,\nfacts and a narrative. Eight LangGraph nodes, four\nof them run in parallel. Progress streams to the\nbrowser as Server-Sent Events (SSE); each run is\nstored in Postgres and traced in Langfuse.",
      "originalText": "Turns a topic plus tonality, audience, length and\nlocale into a structured story: light side, dark side,\nfacts and a narrative. Eight LangGraph nodes, four\nof them run in parallel. Progress streams to the\nbrowser as Server-Sent Events (SSE); each run is\nstored in Postgres and traced in Langfuse.",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 10,
      "autoResize": true
